                            <div class="text-container">
                                
                                
                                <h3 class="title new-bnr-h3">Box Sealer Status Indication
                                    
                                </h3>
                                <p class="new-bnr-p-50">
                                    A solution was needed to better indicate a variety of complex statuses coming from a labeling machine. Banner&#39;s CL50 Pro column lights are an effective way to provide at-a-glance status indication.
</p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="button-wrapper">
                                
                                
                                
                                
                                
                            </div>
                        </div>
